# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: ProtocolDataUnit and ProtocolControlInformation are
# disjoint. ISO/IEC 7498-1, 5.6.1.3: a protocol data unit CONSISTS OF control
# information, so it is not itself control information.
@prefix iso7498: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#> .
@prefix inst: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498/instances#> .
@prefix ex: <https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso7498/neg#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso7498/neg03> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498/instances/2.0.0> .
ex:Unit a iso7498:ProtocolDataUnit , iso7498:ProtocolControlInformation .
